From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: wuming <eva2show@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 06:53:16 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 04/11] desktop: preinstall extra default bundles

DSH_DESKTOP_EXTRA_BUNDLE_DIRS in the platform dotenv file lists bundle package directories, relative to the repository root. Packaging packs each into the dsh package set as an additional root and records the package names in the application manifest (dshDesktopDefaultBundles). The packaged main process publishes them as DSH_DESKTOP_DEFAULT_BUNDLES; new profiles select them after the shipped Web bundles, every launch selects any that a profile lacks, and recovery keeps them selected.

